<p>Raw Cashew	  3,000 (ULD)     Smirdan		  14/12</p>
<p>Motor Spirit	7,000 (LDD)     Vishwa Doot	    15/12</p>
<p>Kerosene	   10,000 (ULD)     Nand Hari		17/12</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
